This is an unofficial tree. It follows the conventions of, and contains files
adapted from, the following official LineageOS device trees (branch
lineage-24.0), all licensed under the Apache License 2.0 by The LineageOS
Project:

  - android_device_samsung_sm8250-common  (Samsung Qualcomm common layer:
    config.fs, SEPolicy, Wi-Fi overlay, framework overlays, init layout,
    recovery init script, sensor NDK bridge shim)
  - android_device_oneplus_sm8150-common  (SM8150/msmnile platform layer:
    power hint configuration, board configuration)
  - android_device_samsung_exynos9820-common and android_device_samsung_beyond2lte
    (same-generation Samsung conventions, extract-utils usage)

The framework overlay and init.samsung.display.rc carry Android Open Source
Project headers.

The init scripts, ueventd rules, fstab, properties and VINTF entries are taken
from the stock Samsung SM-T865 firmware (T865XXU6DXE1 vendor, T865XXU6DXJ1
boot/recovery/system) and remain the property of their respective owners
(Samsung, Qualcomm / The Linux Foundation, as stated in their headers).

Written for this port by lunar-seal, with the assistance of an AI model (see the
commit trailers): the pm_proxy_helper and health HAL SEPolicy, the "unofficial"
strings of the setup wizard and the Updater address, and the changes to the
files above. They are not the work of The LineageOS Project.


